# Transcriber - Audio/Video to Subtitles

## Descriere
Acest proiect transcrie fisiere audio si video in subtitrari (.srt) folosind OpenAI Whisper.
Disponibil in doua variante: Python (GUI cu tkinter) si PowerShell (interfata consola colorata).

---

## PowerShell Version (transcriber.ps1)

### Formate suportate
- **Audio**: .mp3
- **Video**: .mp4, .mov, .mkv, .avi, .wmv

### Functionalitati
- Transcriere audio/video in subtitrari romanesti (.srt)
- Traducere optionala a subtitrarii in engleza (RO -> EN)
- Selectare model Whisper (tiny, base, small, medium, large-v1, large-v2, large-v3, large-v3-turbo)
- Post-procesare SRT (merge subtitrari scurte, split cele lungi)
- Sistem de recovery (reia procesarea dupa intrerupere)
- Interfata colorata si prietenoasa in consola

### Cerinte
- PowerShell 7+ (pwsh)
- Python 3.8+
- OpenAI Whisper (`pip install openai-whisper`)
- FFmpeg

### Instalare dependente
```powershell
# Instaleaza Python si FFmpeg (daca nu sunt deja instalate)

# Instaleaza whisper
pip install openai-whisper

# Sau cu torch CPU:
pip install torch --index-url https://download.pytorch.org/whl/cpu
pip install -U openai-whisper
```

### Utilizare
```powershell
# Ruleaza scriptul interactiv
.\transcriber.ps1

# Afiseaza versiunea
.\transcriber.ps1 -ShowVersion

# Creeaza fisierul de configurare implicit
.\transcriber.ps1 -Init

# Specifica un fisier de configurare diferit
.\transcriber.ps1 -ConfigFile "my_config.yaml"
```

