## Python Version (mp3-to-text-v57.py)

### Cerinte
```bash
# Verifica versiunea Python
python -m pip --version

# Instaleaza dependentele
python -m pip install whisper openai-whisper srt rich tqdm pyyaml

# Instaleaza PyYAML si rich
python -m pip install --upgrade pip
python -m pip install rich tqdm PyYAML

# Verifica modulele
python -c "import yaml, rich; print('Modules OK')"

# Instaleaza whisper
python -m pip install torch --index-url https://download.pytorch.org/whl/cpu
python -m pip install -U openai-whisper
```

### Utilizare
```bash
# Ruleaza scriptul
python mp3-to-text-v57.py

# Sau versiunea CLI
python mp3-to-text.py --version
python mp3-to-text.py --init
python mp3-to-text.py
```

### Executabil (.exe)
```bash
# Instaleaza pyinstaller
python -m pip install pyinstaller

# Creeaza .exe
pyinstaller mp3-transcriber.spec
```
